   "url": "https://pub-4b20b43f5acf4dfaa3f6ab842daa51cf.r2.dev/2d3b0242-9a6d-4051-9825-46aa4efd064a/larch/plugins/ember-song-card/1793254280477_song-card-shot-desk-111.webp",
   "caption": "桌機：歌詞照秒數亮起，左上角是正在播的歌"
  },
  {
